{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222030","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1522203001:1":{"text":"You can't do this... Your life's already better than ours. Why are you fighting us for the little food we've got left?","source_cn":"你们不能这样……你们的生活已经比很多人都好了，为什么还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC81E3EA12DDA984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522203002:0":{"text":"It's just not... *Cough*... it's not right...","source_cn":"这根本……咳咳！不公平……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA04A130D9F7E0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522203003:0":{"text":"Not right? It's not my fault you're poor!","source_cn":"有什么公不公平的？你们没钱又不是我的错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4535D3BAAB479176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522203004:1":{"text":"We've all been starving. What, you think we're hoarding bread in secret?","source_cn":"饥荒这么久，你们没东西，难道我们就有吗？整个呼临城谁没受灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE2DE0500CB9EB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522203005:0":{"text":"But you... *Cough*... you can still buy food! We can't!","source_cn":"但是你们……咳……你们不缺粮食！你们有钱买啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EC32567D46E6ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522203006:0":{"text":"Buy? With what? My farm's dried up, thanks to the drought, I've got nothing to harvest, and I'm buried in debt!","source_cn":"谁说我有钱了？呼临城和整片高原都干旱，我家的农田一点收...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182EADFA89F3AC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522203007:0":{"text":"Then explain those clothes. Look at us. Look at you!","source_cn":"你看看你穿的是什么，我们穿的是什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85CB9E5EE0C76418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522203008:0":{"text":"If that's what \"poor\" looks like, then I—","source_cn":"要是你还没钱，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5D235F1A245893B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522203009:0":{"text":"That's enough! All of you, quiet!","source_cn":"——吵什么吵！都给我闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417A5D78313DC653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522203010:0":{"text":"Kalan, report. What's going on?","source_cn":"卡利安，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE7E5554E66344E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522203011:0":{"text":"Sir, it's... someone cut in line. The others didn't take it well...","source_cn":"报告副将，是……是有人插队，其他人有所不满……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B86F4F6EA3518E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522203012:0":{"text":"You useless fool. Can't even manage a food line. Ten written reports on my desk by tomorrow!","source_cn":"丢人现眼的蠢货，发放赈灾粮这点差事你都干不好，回去写十...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2A1E6698136023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522203013:0":{"text":"And the rest of you, form a line! No yelling, no grabbing. If I see another fight, no one gets fed!","source_cn":"至于你们，全都给我站成一列，不许争抢，不然粮食不予发放！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADB907A02F563F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522203014:1":{"text":"It's not just about lines anymore! Why's someone like him getting relief food at all?!","source_cn":"现在已经不是插队的问题了！是他这种有钱人凭什么来领赈灾粮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92EF874F488978D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522203015:0":{"text":"You're the lieutenant, right? <style=\"highlight\">Perseus' right hand</style>? Then do something! You can't just let this slide!","source_cn":"你是副将？<style=highlight>珀尔修斯统...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D874ABAD0A8900A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1522203016:0":{"text":"Do what, exactly? Hand-deliver all the food to your front door?","source_cn":"还要怎么给你们做主？难不成要把所有赈灾粮都运到你家里去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x350AA42C69128525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1522203017:0":{"text":"You—!","source_cn":"你——！<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC886CB768652C962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1522203018:0":{"text":"Didn't you hear the lieutenant? Get in line, or get nothing.","source_cn":"没听到副将刚才说的吗？赶紧排好队，要不然就没粮食了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ED0AD3C5417943D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1522203019:0":{"text":"You bastard... Forget the food. I'm gonna teach you a lesson!","source_cn":"你这个混蛋……我今天不要粮食了，就要打你一顿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD9E75D43DF61F58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:尼姆":{"text":"Nim","source":"尼姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊阿宋":{"text":"Jakon","source":"伊阿宋","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西蒙":{"text":"Siman","source":"西蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:副将隆尔":{"text":"Lieutenant Lygos","source":"副将隆尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:士兵卡利安":{"text":"Soldier Kalan","source":"士兵卡利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":5}}